<% content_for :title, "BonID Reset Request Received" %>

<h2 style="color: var(--haitian-blue); font-weight: 700;">Reset Request Received</h2>

<div class="status-card" style="border-left-color: var(--haitian-blue); background: #f8f9ff;">
  <strong>Status:</strong> Pending Review<br>
  Your request to reset your BonID is being reviewed.
</div>

<p>Dear <strong><%= @submission.user.first_name %></strong>,</p>

<p>
  We’ve received your BonID reset request. Our verification team will review
  your submission and verify the provided details before issuing a new BonID.
</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= citizens_identity_submissions_url %>" class="button">View My Requests</a>
</p>

<p>
  You will receive another notification once your request is approved or rejected.
</p>

<p>BonID Verification Team</p>
